			description: [
				" Congratulations, fearless adventurer! With the &lForge Rocket&r fully assembled, you’ve achieved a feat few could dream of-unlocking the path to &oThe Forge&r, the final planet steeped in ancient power and untold secrets. This is no ordinary destination. It is the culmination of every trial you've faced, every world you've conquered."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As a reward for your triumph, you’ve earned a &6rare celestial trophy&r-an artifact of immense value. This key unlocks the ability to craft a &llegendary fuel&r, essential for reaching The Forge in a future update. Safeguard it well, for it will be the ignition spark of a journey like no other."
			]
