		{
			description: [
				"&7Forged in ambition and bound for legend, the &eForge Rocket&r is your gateway to the most elusive destination yet-&6The Forge&r. Launching with the &lv3.0 update&r, this powerful vessel is more than transportation-it's your &ofinal test of mastery&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Upon arrival, you’ll descend into &6an ancient stronghold&r built to challenge every ounce of your strength, cunning, and resilience. Within the maze-like halls of The Forge lie powerful mechanisms, intricate trials, and a &lcustom final boss encounter&r forged to push even the greatest adventurers to their limits."
				""
				"Conquer these trials, and you’ll earn more than glory-you’ll receive a &brare relic&r capable of unlocking the ultimate reward: the &lability to craft Creative-tier items&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"This isn’t just a journey to a new planet-it’s a battle for legacy. A proving ground for those who seek to ascend beyond mortal limits."
				""
				" &lWill you master The Forge and unlock the power of creation-or fall beneath the weight of its challenges?&r"
				""
				"The stars have watched your journey. Now, they watch your final trial."
			]
